---
description: Wording for the CLI's output, errors and docs
alwaysApply: true
---

# User-facing copy

- Short, plain, specific: say what is wrong and what to do ("not in hosts:
  local.acme.test", "run devmagic -ci first"), not that "an error occurred".
- Name real things: paths, commands, domains, in `code` style in docs.
- No em dashes. No exclamation marks. New output adds no emoji.
